{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CfcSD4mDPrEEj7hLC117f", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I sampled the average color of each candidate video every few seconds and compared the results with the barcode. The barcode goes from blue at the start to pink, then purples, blue again, pink, brown, and ends on dark purples. BLACKPINK's DDU-DU DDU-DU (C) is the closest match: it opens blue (2e4f7a), turns pink (bb7c97), then moves through purples and finishes on dark purple (422d4a).\n\nNone of the other videos fit that shape. Boy With Luv (E) stays mostly in warm beiges and browns. Kill This Love (F) is close in places but runs orange and red in the middle, and Gangnam Style, Dynamite and the two kids' videos are all much lighter overall.\n\nThis comparison was coarse: I averaged each video into about ten segments and matched them by eye. I didn't line it up stripe by stripe.\n\nAnswer: C"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1084, "cache_read_input_tokens": 6490, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1084}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "not_available"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "7b1b995c-de17-41cd-ac1a-2ce620c8f464", "uuid": "b43f54dd-4701-48cb-8ee6-bfd5d0c0f7f3", "timestamp": "2026-10-02T00:06:52.316Z", "request_id": "req_011CfcSD4Kgf237tzmkG9Yqj"}
